  G[EP].notZ+.all        FLS         .     .     .     .     .
  G[STURM].irr.all       PRV      part     .     .     .  part   T1: DRIFT: the 5n+1 analogue is PROVED too; PC: DRIFT
  G[SUB].irr.all         PRV      part     .     .     .  part   T1: DRIFT: the 5n+1 analogue is PROVED too; PC: DRIFT
  G[BCD].notZ+.all       PRV      part     .     .     .     .   T1: critical slope only: orbits with bounded discrepancy grow at most linearly
  G[BCD].irr.all         PRV         .     .     .     .  part   PC: critical slope only
